disorder, panic attacks, or addiction; or a diagnosed learning disability?","es":"7. ¿Tratamiento ahora (o en 5 años) por temas psicológicos, trastorno de personalidad, pánico o adicción; o discapacidad del aprendizaje diagnosticada?"}},{"key":"dm_box_E","type":"yes_no","sensitive":true,"show_if":{"field":"dm_q7","op":"eq","value":"yes"},"label":{"en":"Box E — Mental health care needed; major depression, suicidal thoughts, panic, or bipolar on treatment; learning/developmental disorder in ongoing care; addiction treatment in 5 years?","es":"Casilla E — Atención de salud mental; depresión mayor, ideas suicidas, pánico o bipolar en tratamiento; trastorno del aprendizaje con cuidado continuo; tratamiento por adicción en 5 años?"}},{"key":"dm_q8","type":"yes_no","required":true,"sensitive":true,"label":{"en":"8. Back problems, hernia, ulcers, or diabetes?","es":"8. ¿Problemas de espalda, hernia, úlceras o diabetes?"}},{"key":"dm_box_F","type":"yes_no","sensitive":true,"show_if":{"field":"dm_q8","op":"eq","value":"yes"},"label":{"en":"Box F — Recurring back pain limiting activity (6 mo); spine surgery (12 mo); diabetes or gestational diabetes (12 mo); hernia limiting activity; active ulcers or ulcer surgery (6 mo)?","es":"Casilla F — Dolor de espalda recurrente que limita (6 meses); cirugía de columna (12 meses); diabetes o gestacional (12 meses); hernia que limita; úlceras activas o cirugía (6 meses)?"}},{"key":"dm_q9","type":"yes_no","required":true,"sensitive":true,"label":{"en":"9. Stomach or intestine problems, including recent diarrhea?","es":"9. ¿Problemas de estómago o intestino, incluida diarrea reciente?"}},{"key":"dm_box_G","type":"yes_no","sensitive":true,"show_if":{"field":"dm_q9","op":"eq","value":"yes"},"label":{"en":"Box G — Ostomy without swim clearance; dehydration needing care (7 days); stomach ulcers or ulcer surgery (6 mo); frequent heartburn/GERD; active colitis or Crohn’s; bariatric surgery (12 mo)?","es":"Casilla G — Ostomía sin autorización para nadar; deshidratación con atención (7 días); úlceras o cirugía (6 meses); acidez/ERGE frecuente; colitis o Crohn activo; cirugía bariátrica (12 meses)?"}},{"key":"dm_q10","type":"yes_no","required":true,"sensitive":true,"label":{"en":"10. Taking prescription medication (except birth control, or anti-malarials other than mefloquine/Lariam)? (physician if YES)","es":"10. ¿Tomas medicación con receta (excepto anticonceptivos, o antimaláricos distintos de mefloquina/Lariam)? (médico si SÍ)"}}]},{"id":"physician_stub","title":{"en":"Physician section","es":"Sección del médico"},"fields":[{"key":"__physician_blank","type":"checkbox","label":{"en":"(Left blank for physician — shop adds Diving Medical Guidance when needed)","es":"(En blanco para el médico — la tienda añade la Guía Médica si hace falta)"}}]}]}', updated_at=1792988138514 WHERE key='diver_medical';
